C DATA2D              INDICATORS FOR STRUCTURE OF EXECUTION
C
C INDIC                  VALUE ON INDICATOR CARD
C NORAYS                 NUMBER OF TRAJECTORIES (TURTLE)
C NPSTEP                 NUMBER OF PROBLEM STEPS (TIMES TITLE AND INDICATOR
C                        ENCOUNTERED)
C NPASS                  NUMBER OF PASS (BEFORE OR AFTER FITTING)
C NPARMS                 NUMBER OF PARAMETERS USED TO DESCRIBE A GIVEN ELEMENT
C
      COMMON /DATA2D/ INDIC, NORAYS, NPSTEP, NPASS, NPARMS
